ed_at":"2026-10-29T20:23:11Z"},{"id":689802326,"node_id":"RA_kwDON4OD8c4pHYxW","name":"excel_mcp_server-2.2.3.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-gtar","state":"uploaded","size":367964,"digest":"sha256:7db5f7d1e95152a7c45017001bc10db34d590454173b09b43ee516018f21bc0a","download_count":5,"created_at":"2026-10-29T20:23:11Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T20:23:11Z"}],"body":"Security release. Upgrade recommended: `uvx excel-mcp-server@latest`.\n\n\n### Security\n\n- A crafted workbook can no longer make saving it take quadratic time (GHSA-5px3-v5xm-4jhw,\n  reported by @q7256). Conditional formats of Excel 2010 that the server cannot restore are\n  removed in one pass over the sheet's extensions instead of one pass per rule. The same flaw\n  is fixed wherever preserved content was rescanned per item: elements that close themselves\n  in sparkline, conditional format and validation extensions, the relationships and part names\n  of a package, cells with dynamic array metadata, and slicer caches that no slicer uses.\n\n","mentions_count":1}
